<title>JAPAN: Omron says to annouce tie-up with U.S. Harmonix.</title>
<headline>Omron says to annouce tie-up with U.S. Harmonix.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omron Corp said on Wednesday it would announce at 0700 GMT a technical tie-up with U.S. software company Harmonix Corp.</p>
<p>Omron, Japan's top maker of control components based in Kyoto, will also announce a capital participation in the Massachusetts-based firm, an Omron spokeswoman said without elaborating.</p>
